    \"https://plugins.dprint.dev/toml-0.8.0.wasm\"\n     ]\n   }\n   ```\n\n## JS Formatting API\n\n* [JS Formatter](https://github.com/dprint/js-formatter) - Browser/Deno and Node\n* [npm package](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@dprint/toml)\n\n"}